- content_for :title, "Privacy"

- content_for :masthead do
  .container.masthead__body
    %h1.masthead__title Privacy

.container.prose
  %p We collect as little as possible.
  %ul
    %li
      When you click through to a booking or activity site we record which property and site, the dates you searched
      and the page you clicked on. We do not store your IP address or any identifier that could tell us who you are.
    %li The site sets only the technically necessary session cookie. We do not use advertising or analytics cookies.
    %li
      Booking and activity sites set their own cookies once you arrive there, including to attribute your booking to us; their
      privacy policies apply. Some links pass through Stay22 on the way, which receives your IP address and the
      property and dates you chose, under its own privacy policy.
    %li
      To show prices, our server asks Stay22 for the dates and number of guests you searched. It sends nothing about you:
      no IP address, cookie or other identifier.
    %li Map tiles are loaded from the map tile server, which receives your IP address like any web server would.
